### Teste: Criar Venda com Modalidade de Frete CIF (Emitente Paga)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "status": "QUOTE",
  "shippingCost": 85.50,
  "shippingModality": 0,
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "{{productId}}",
      "quantity": 5,
      "unitPrice": 129.90
    }
  ]
}

