### Teste: Listar Vendas (Verificar Modalidade)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### Teste: Buscar Venda por ID (Verificar Modalidade)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/sales/{{saleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### Cenário Completo: Criar Venda → Confirmar → Emitir NFe

# 1. Criar orçamento com frete
POST http://localhost:3000/api/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "status": "QUOTE",
  "shippingCost": 75.00,
  "shippingModality": 0,
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "{{productId}}",
      "quantity": 3,
      "unitPrice": 150.00
    }
  ]
}

# Salvar o ID da venda criada: {{saleId}}

###

# 2. Confirmar venda
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/sales/{{saleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "CONFIRMED"
}

###

# 3. Emitir NFe (modalidade herdada da venda)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/nfe/from-sale
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "saleId": "{{saleId}}",
  "serie": "1",
  "naturezaOperacao": "Venda de mercadoria"
}

###

